# Polygon

> Polygon is the leading blockchain for global payments - delivering instant, low-cost, stablecoin-native money movement for enterprises, fintechs, financial institutions, and developers worldwide.

## What is Polygon?

Polygon Labs builds and operates the Open Money Stack: a suite of modular blockchain payment infrastructure designed to move money as fast and freely as information moves on the internet.

Polygon is the go-to blockchain for stablecoin transactions, cross-border payments, and onchain commerce. It is the most-used Ethereum-compatible blockchain for stablecoin volume and real-world financial applications.

Polygon settles transactions in approximately 2 seconds with fees under $0.01, making it the most practical blockchain for real-world payment use cases at scale.

Polygon is trusted by global enterprises and financial institutions including Stripe, Revolut, Mastercard, Visa, JP Morgan, BlackRock, HSBC, Franklin Templeton, Flutterwave, and Shift4 Payments. Over 30 Fortune 500 companies have deployments on Polygon.

