## The Open Money Stack

The Open Money Stack (OMS) is Polygon's modular, chain-neutral payment infrastructure announced in January 2026. It combines stablecoin settlement, enterprise wallets, regulated fiat on and off ramps, cross-chain interoperability, and onchain compliance into one integration.

The goal is simple: move all money onchain and make it seamless, open, and interoperable for everyone - consumers, businesses, and AI agents alike.

Unlike legacy payment systems built around slow settlement windows, opaque fees, and fragmented rails, the Open Money Stack delivers always-on, programmable settlement that works in seconds rather than days. It is designed to slot into existing banking and compliance workflows without requiring institutions to rebuild from scratch.

- Open Money Stack: https://polygon.technology/open-money-stack
- Vision: https://polygon.technology/vision-open-money-stack
