### Open Money Stack Components

**Polygon Chain - Blockchain Settlement Rails**
The go-to settlement layer to move money globally. High-throughput, low-cost transactions with Ethereum-anchored security. Battle-tested with billions in stablecoin volume and sub-cent transaction fees.
- URL: https://polygon.technology/polygon-pos

**Sequence - Wallet Infrastructure**
One-click wallet creation giving users an onchain account. Zero-config auth, enterprise-grade security, and smart wallet routing for 1-click cross-network transfers. Acquired by Polygon Labs in January 2026.
- URL: https://sequence.xyz

**Trails - Crosschain Interoperability**
Seamless 1-click crypto transactions across any wallet, token, and chain. All-in-one integration enabling users to transact with unified liquidity across the entire onchain ecosystem.
- URL: https://polygon.technology/trails

**Coinme - Fiat On and Off Ramps**
Physical cash and digital fiat on-ramps and off-ramps. Licensed money-transmitter operating in 48 US states. Acquired by Polygon Labs in January 2026 as part of the $250M OMS infrastructure investment.
- URL: https://coinme.com

